## Flex

* [Flex digital concierge | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/flex/use-cases/digital-concierge.md): An in-app digital concierge service that gives your customer service teams the omnichannel reach, customer data, and integrations to deliver personal service at scale and grow customer lifetime value.
