## User-Authentication-Identity

* [Lookup API | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/user-authentication-identity/lookup.md): Validate number format and look up provider and device type to reach verified users via voice and text. Free to use.
* [Verify API | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/user-authentication-identity/verify.md): Validate users across SMS and preferred channels at scale with the Twilio Verify API, a turnkey, passwordless authentication solution that enables seamless and secure user onboarding, reduces fraud, and optimizes delivery rates without the heavy lifting. Twilio handles all your connectivity, channels, OTP generation, and more—so you don’t have to.
* [Twilio Verify at a glance | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/user-authentication-identity/verify/fact-sheet.md): Validate users across SMS and preferred channels at scale with the Twilio Verify API, a turnkey, passwordless authentication solution that enables seamless and secure user onboarding, reduces fraud, and optimizes delivery rates without the heavy lifting. Twilio handles all your connectivity, channels, OTP generation, and more—so you don’t have to.

