## User Authentication & Identity | Twilio

* [User Authentication & Identity | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/user-authentication-identity.md): Optimize conversions, customer experience, and account security at once with Twilio’s end-to-end verification solution. Build frictionless, no-input authorization experiences for onboarding, transactions, and the full customer lifecycle using customizable, real-time verification tools and authoritative phone data validation. Twilio User Authentication & Identity uses behind-the-scenes mobile carrier data to identify then fast-track real users into frictionless verification, while unauthorized users face added security. It’s smart onboarding that drives growth and trust.

