* [Sendgrid Engagement Quality Score API](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/changelog/SEQ.md): Introducing the SendGrid Engagement Quality Score now available via API! The SEQ score is a composite deliverability score that focuses on engagement related feedback from mailbox providers. The top level score will tell you at a glance how strong your deliverability is, but you can also drill down into your performance against the following 5 dimensions: Bounce Classification, Bounce rate, Engagement Recency, Open Rate and Spam Rate. Improving these dimensions will directly support optimizing deliverability and reach
