* [[U.S. A2P 10DLC] Brand Registration Error Codes](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/changelog/-u-s--a2p-10dlc--brand-registration-error-codes.md): We are excited to announce an enhancement in the A2P 10DLC Brand registration process. In our ongoing efforts to streamline and improve the user experience, we have now implemented standardized error codes for any failures or issues encountered during Brand registration. These error codes will be directly available through the errors attribute on the Brand. With this release, it’s important to note that brand_feedback and failure_reason will be deprecated in an upcoming release. We understand that changes in API attributes can impact your existing integrations. If you have used these attributes in your integrations, we strongly advise transitioning to the new 'errors' attribute due to its pending deprecation and limited information. For a detailed overview of the new error codes, their possible causes, and solutions, please refer to our updated Brand registration Twilio docs for Sole Prop and Low Volume Standard/Standard.
