## Use-Cases

* [Get Customer Insights](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/customer-insights.md): With clean, unified customer data, Twilio Segment can help you gain clear insights into your customer behavior, needs, and pain points.
* [Audience Segmentation & Activation](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/segmentation-audience-activation.md): Experience the power you can unlock through advanced customer segmentation and audience activation by using the choice solution for CDPs, Twilio Segment.
* [How to Build Account Notification Solutions | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/commerce-communications/account-notifications/build.md): Learn how to build account notification solutions with Twilio Messaging APIs. Add custom SMS account notifications for customers based on events you choose.
* [Appointment reminder texts and emails](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/appointment-reminders.md): Sending appointment reminders with Twilio can reduce lost revenue from missed appointments. Learn more about appointment reminder texts and emails from Twilio.
* [Customer support and sales solutions](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/support-and-sales.md): Build intelligent self-service and AI assistance into your customer support experience to automate repetitive tasks and improve customer experience.
* [User verification and mobile identity signals | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/user-verification-identity.md): Protect customer accounts and transactions from fraud with seamless two-factor authentication and mobile identity signals.
* [Automated customer surveys | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/automated-customer-surveys.md): It’s easy to create automated SMS surveys, email surveys, WhatsApp surveys, phone surveys and more with Twilio to get feedback from your customers.
* [Call tracking | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/call-tracking.md): Use Twilio to build phone call tracking into your software. Start to measure campaign effectiveness, accurately attribute calls, and personalize interactions.
* [Alerts and notifications: Texts and emails | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/alerts-and-notifications.md): Send SMS alerts and text notifications to inform, engage, and get customers to take action. Set up use cases like appointment reminders and text alerts.
* [Marketing and Promotions Use Cases | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/marketing-and-promotions.md): Use Twilio to add new communication channels and improve engagement for marketing and promotions. Reach customers with SMS texts, email, voice, and WhatsApp.
* [Customer acquisition activation](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/customer-acquisition-activation.md): Move beyond generic tactics with personalized, well-timed messages that boost conversion and lower costs.
* [Interactive voice response (IVR) solutions | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/ivr.md): Expand your existing contact center functionality. Add on an IVR solution with AI virtual agents to automate self-service, reduce costs, and increase CSAT.
* [Enrich Customer Profiles](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/enrich-customer-profiles.md): Explore how Twilio Segment's customer data platform can help you build and enrich customer profiles to provide relevant customer experiences in real time.
* [Voice AI Agents | Elevate Every Call Experience](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/voice-AI.md): Transform customer support with Twilio Voice AI. Automate requests, boost satisfaction, and scale seamlessly with our cutting-edge solutions. Sign up now!
* [Optimize ad spend](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/optimize-ad-spend.md): Reach the right customers at the right time and cut the spend that’s not driving results.
* [Customer Data Management & Integration](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/customer-data-management-integration.md): Discover how to analyze user intents and uncover high-value keywords that drive conversions. Enhance your SEO strategy with actionable tips!
* [Lead alerts | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/lead-alerts.md): Instant lead alerts empower you to react faster to website leads and engage customers with SMS and email. Learn how Twilio enables real-time lead management.
* [Alerts and notifications: Texts and emails | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/alerts-and-notifications-v2.md): Alerts and notifications can inform, engage, and get customers to take action. Learn more uses like appointment reminders and security alerts with Twilio.
* [Mass texting service](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/mass-texting.md): Sending messages at scale doesn't have to be complicated. Easily engage with large audiences with Twilio's bulk text messaging service.
* [Customer LTV and retention](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/retain-customers-increase-ltv.md): Learn how Twilio Segement's customer data platform can unlock the ability to retain and increase LTV of existing customers through personalization features.
* [Activate customer data](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/activate-customer-data.md): Explore how Twilio Segment's extensible customer data platform can help you quickly and easily create and activate unified customer profiles across every tool you use.
* [Cross-sell and upsell](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/boost-cross-sell-upsell.md): Leverage unified data & AI-powered journeys to offer relevant upgrades and grow customer revenue.
* [Single View of Customer Solution](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/single-customer-view.md): Drive personalized experiences with precise identity resolution and seamless data activation. Learn why 25,000+ companies trust Segment. Discover more today!
* [Fraud prevention | Twilio](https://www.twilio.com/en-us/use-cases/fraud-prevention.md): Prevent fraud, protect your business and customers, with a complete solution for user authentication and identity verification.

