* [Configure Salesforce SSO with Flex](/docs/flex/admin-guide/setup/sso-configuration/salesforce.md): Step-by-step instructions for setting up Salesforce single sign-on (SSO) with Twilio Flex as a SAML 2.0 identity provider, including certificate setup.
