* [Create Tasks from Phone Calls using TwiML: Receive an Incoming Call](/docs/taskrouter/quickstart/ruby/twiml-receive-call.md): Set up a Ruby and Sinatra endpoint to receive an incoming Twilio phone call and use TwiML to prompt the caller for a language before creating a TaskRouter Task.
